<title>SINGAPORE: Asiamatrix sees better 1997.</title>
<headline>Asiamatrix sees better 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastic injection moulded components maker Asiamatrix Ltd said on Tuesday it expected to perform better in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;With the continuing implementation of the rationalisation exercise, the directors expect the performance of the group to improve in 1997,&quot; it said in a statement accompanying its 1996 results.</p>
<p>Asiamatrix reported a loss of Singapore $3.23 million for the fiscal yar ended December 31 1996, compared to a loss of S$4.93 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
